# Cursor Rules — Second Brain App

## Project
AI-powered note taking app. Next.js 14 frontend + FastAPI Python backend + LangChain RAG.

## Frontend Rules
- TypeScript strict mode always
- "use client" directive on all interactive components
- Tailwind CSS only — no inline styles, no CSS modules
- Use `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` for conditional classes
- State: Zustand (`useAppStore`) for UI state, React Query for server state
- API calls only through `@/lib/api.ts`
- Import alias: `@/` maps to `src/`

## Backend Rules  
- Python 3.12, FastAPI, async everywhere
- Pydantic v2 models for all I/O
- Keep routers thin — logic in services/
- LangChain for all LLM/embedding operations
- Type hints on every function

## Code Style
- Prefer explicit over clever
- Small focused functions
- Descriptive variable names
- No commented-out code in PRs
